<fo:block id="W0111-00-0030-it-061f" text-align="justify" start-indent="16pt" space-before="0.2cm" space-after="0.2cm"><fo:inline> </fo:inline><fo:inline space-before="0.2cm" space-after="0.2cm"><fo:basic-link internal-destination="W0111-00-0033-mi-0405" color="#0a0c75">8</fo:basic-link> </fo:inline> <fo:inline font-style="italic">Iudicis in ab<fo:inline font-weight="normal">s</fo:inline>olutione aut condẽnatione ab<fo:inline font-weight="normal">s</fo:inline>entis diligentia commendatur,</fo:inline></fo:block>
<fo:block id="W0111-00-0030-it-0620" text-align="justify" start-indent="16pt" space-before="0.2cm" space-after="0.2cm"><fo:inline> </fo:inline><fo:inline space-before="0.2cm" space-after="0.2cm"><fo:basic-link internal-destination="W0111-00-0033-mi-0407" color="#0a0c75">9</fo:basic-link> </fo:inline> <fo:inline font-style="italic">Habitus pro confe<fo:inline font-weight="normal">s</fo:inline><fo:inline font-weight="normal">s</fo:inline>o an <fo:inline font-weight="normal">s</fo:inline>icut delictũ, ita etiã qualita<fo:inline> </fo:inline>tes delictũ aggrauant esfateri videatur.</fo:inline></fo:block>
<fo:block id="W0111-00-0030-it-0621" text-align="justify" start-indent="16pt" space-before="0.2cm" space-after="0.2cm"><fo:inline> </fo:inline><fo:inline space-before="0.2cm" space-after="0.2cm"><fo:basic-link internal-destination="W0111-00-0033-mi-0409" color="#0a0c75">10</fo:basic-link> </fo:inline> <fo:inline font-style="italic">Ab<fo:inline font-weight="normal">s</fo:inline>entiæ cau<fo:inline font-weight="normal">s</fo:inline>as <fo:inline font-weight="normal">s</fo:inline>i amicus, vel coniũcta per<fo:inline font-weight="normal">s</fo:inline>ona in iu<fo:inline> </fo:inline>dicio appareat allegãdo, an iudex audire teneatur.</fo:inline></fo:block>
<fo:block id="W0111-00-0030-it-0622" text-align="justify" start-indent="16pt" space-before="0.2cm" space-after="0.2cm"><fo:inline> </fo:inline><fo:inline space-before="0.2cm" space-after="0.2cm"><fo:basic-link internal-destination="W0111-00-0034-mi-040b" color="#0a0c75">11</fo:basic-link> </fo:inline> <fo:inline font-style="italic">Bonorũ annotationis loco in pœnam cõtumaciæ, quid<fo:inline> </fo:inline>hodie <fo:inline font-weight="normal">s</fo:inline>urrogetur, o<fo:inline font-weight="normal">s</fo:inline>tenditur.</fo:inline></fo:block>
<fo:block id="W0111-00-0030-it-0623" text-align="justify" start-indent="16pt" space-before="0.2cm" space-after="0.2cm"><fo:inline> </fo:inline><fo:inline space-before="0.2cm" space-after="0.2cm"><fo:basic-link internal-destination="W0111-00-0034-mi-040d" color="#0a0c75">12</fo:basic-link> </fo:inline> <fo:inline font-style="italic">Habitus pro confe<fo:inline font-weight="normal">s</fo:inline><fo:inline font-weight="normal">s</fo:inline>o eo quòd non cõparuerit in termi<fo:inline> </fo:inline>no, <fo:inline font-weight="normal">s</fo:inline>i<fo:inline font-weight="normal">s</fo:inline>e <fo:inline font-weight="normal">s</fo:inline>ponte p<fo:inline font-weight="normal">s</fo:inline>entet, ꝙ purget morã, &amp; audiatur.</fo:inline></fo:block>
<fo:block id="W0111-00-0031-it-0624" text-align="justify" start-indent="16pt" space-before="0.2cm" space-after="0.2cm"><fo:inline font-style="normal" id="W0111-00-0031-pb-0405"/><fo:inline role="W0111-00-0031-pb-0405" font-style="normal" font-weight="bold" font-size="12pt">[Fol.[3]v]</fo:inline><fo:inline> </fo:inline><fo:inline space-before="0.2cm" space-after="0.2cm"><fo:basic-link internal-destination="W0111-00-0034-mi-040e" color="#0a0c75">13</fo:basic-link> </fo:inline> <fo:inline font-style="italic">Reus licèt habeatur pro confe<fo:inline font-weight="normal">s</fo:inline><fo:inline font-weight="normal">s</fo:inline>o, an <fo:inline font-weight="normal">s</fo:inline>evolens excu<fo:inline font-weight="normal">s</fo:inline>are audirt debeat, o<fo:inline font-weight="normal">s</fo:inline>tenditur.</fo:inline></fo:block>
<fo:block id="W0111-00-0031-it-0625" text-align="justify" start-indent="16pt" space-before="0.2cm" space-after="0.2cm"><fo:inline> </fo:inline><fo:inline space-before="0.2cm" space-after="0.2cm"><fo:basic-link internal-destination="W0111-00-0034-mi-0410" color="#0a0c75">14</fo:basic-link> </fo:inline> <fo:inline font-style="italic">Annotationis bonorum loco, quæ propter contumaciam &amp; fugam delinquentis fit, quæ pœna hodie<fo:inline> </fo:inline>veniat.</fo:inline></fo:block>
<fo:block id="W0111-00-0031-it-0626" text-align="justify" start-indent="16pt" space-before="0.2cm" space-after="0.2cm"><fo:inline> </fo:inline><fo:inline space-before="0.2cm" space-after="0.2cm"><fo:basic-link internal-destination="W0111-00-0034-mi-0412" color="#0a0c75">15</fo:basic-link> </fo:inline> <fo:inline font-style="italic">Actio an ex pacto nudo oriatur.</fo:inline></fo:block>
<fo:block id="W0111-00-0031-it-0627" text-align="justify" start-indent="16pt" space-before="0.2cm" space-after="0.2cm"><fo:inline> </fo:inline><fo:inline space-before="0.2cm" space-after="0.2cm"><fo:basic-link internal-destination="W0111-00-0034-mi-0414" color="#0a0c75">16</fo:basic-link> </fo:inline> <fo:inline font-style="italic">Actio an ex pollicitatione oriatur.</fo:inline></fo:block>
<fo:block id="W0111-00-0031-it-0628" text-align="justify" start-indent="16pt" space-before="0.2cm" space-after="0.2cm"><fo:inline> </fo:inline><fo:inline space-before="0.2cm" space-after="0.2cm"><fo:basic-link internal-destination="W0111-00-0034-mi-0416" color="#0a0c75">17</fo:basic-link> </fo:inline> <fo:inline font-style="italic">Obligatio an ex <fo:inline font-weight="normal">s</fo:inline>tipulatione inducatur. Et quid de<fo:inline> </fo:inline>iure regio, o<fo:inline font-weight="normal">s</fo:inline>tenditur.</fo:inline></fo:block>
<fo:block id="W0111-00-0031-it-0629" text-align="justify" start-indent="16pt" space-before="0.2cm" space-after="0.2cm"><fo:inline> </fo:inline><fo:inline space-before="0.2cm" space-after="0.2cm"><fo:basic-link internal-destination="W0111-00-0034-mi-0418" color="#0a0c75">18</fo:basic-link> </fo:inline> <fo:inline font-style="italic">Stipulatio an alteri per alterum acquiratur.</fo:inline></fo:block>
<fo:block id="W0111-00-0031-it-062a" text-align="justify" start-indent="16pt" space-before="0.2cm" space-after="0.2cm"><fo:inline> </fo:inline><fo:inline space-before="0.2cm" space-after="0.2cm"><fo:basic-link internal-destination="W0111-00-0035-mi-041a" color="#0a0c75">19</fo:basic-link> </fo:inline> <fo:inline font-style="italic">Mutus &amp; <fo:inline font-weight="normal">s</fo:inline>urdus an &amp; quando poßint <fo:inline font-weight="normal">s</fo:inline>tipulari.</fo:inline></fo:block>
<fo:block id="W0111-00-0031-it-062b" text-align="justify" start-indent="16pt" space-before="0.2cm" space-after="0.2cm"><fo:inline> </fo:inline><fo:inline space-before="0.2cm" space-after="0.2cm"><fo:basic-link internal-destination="W0111-00-0035-mi-041c" color="#0a0c75">20</fo:basic-link> </fo:inline> <fo:inline font-style="italic">Stipulatio <fo:inline font-weight="normal">s</fo:inline>i fiat duobus alternatiuè, an &amp; quando<fo:inline> </fo:inline>valeat de iure regio.</fo:inline></fo:block>
<fo:block id="W0111-00-0031-it-062c" text-align="justify" start-indent="16pt" space-before="0.2cm" space-after="0.2cm"><fo:inline> </fo:inline><fo:inline space-before="0.2cm" space-after="0.2cm"><fo:basic-link internal-destination="W0111-00-0035-mi-041e" color="#0a0c75">21</fo:basic-link> </fo:inline> <fo:inline font-style="italic">Obligationis verba quando concipiuntur in per<fo:inline font-weight="normal">s</fo:inline>onam<fo:inline> </fo:inline>procuratoris, &amp; verba executionis in per<fo:inline font-weight="normal">s</fo:inline>onam do<fo:inline> </fo:inline>mini, an quæratur domino actio <fo:inline font-weight="normal">s</fo:inline>ine ceßione procuratoris.</fo:inline></fo:block>
<fo:block id="W0111-00-0031-it-062d" text-align="justify" start-indent="16pt" space-before="0.2cm" space-after="0.2cm"><fo:inline> </fo:inline><fo:inline space-before="0.2cm" space-after="0.2cm"><fo:basic-link internal-destination="W0111-00-0035-mi-0420" color="#0a0c75">22</fo:basic-link> </fo:inline> <fo:inline font-style="italic">Fideiu<fo:inline font-weight="normal">s</fo:inline><fo:inline font-weight="normal">s</fo:inline>or an obligetur <fo:inline font-weight="normal">s</fo:inline>ine <fo:inline font-weight="normal">s</fo:inline>tipulatione.</fo:inline></fo:block>
<fo:block id="W0111-00-0031-it-062e" text-align="justify" start-indent="16pt" space-before="0.2cm" space-after="0.2cm"><fo:inline> </fo:inline><fo:inline space-before="0.2cm" space-after="0.2cm"><fo:basic-link internal-destination="W0111-00-0035-mi-0422" color="#0a0c75">23</fo:basic-link> </fo:inline> <fo:inline font-style="italic">Fideiu<fo:inline font-weight="normal">s</fo:inline><fo:inline font-weight="normal">s</fo:inline>or, qui <fo:inline font-weight="normal">s</fo:inline>e in plus obligauit quàm principalis,<fo:inline> </fo:inline>ad quid teneatur.</fo:inline></fo:block>
<fo:block id="W0111-00-0031-it-062f" text-align="justify" start-indent="16pt" space-before="0.2cm" space-after="0.2cm"><fo:inline> </fo:inline><fo:inline space-before="0.2cm" space-after="0.2cm"><fo:basic-link internal-destination="W0111-00-0035-mi-0423" color="#0a0c75">24</fo:basic-link> </fo:inline> <fo:inline font-style="italic">Confe<fo:inline font-weight="normal">s</fo:inline>sio debiti <fo:inline font-weight="normal">s</fo:inline>ine expre<fo:inline font-weight="normal">s</fo:inline>sione cau<fo:inline font-weight="normal">s</fo:inline>æ an <fo:inline font-weight="normal">s</fo:inline>it nulla.</fo:inline></fo:block>
<fo:block id="W0111-00-0031-it-0630" text-align="justify" start-indent="16pt" space-before="0.2cm" space-after="0.2cm"><fo:inline> </fo:inline><fo:inline space-before="0.2cm" space-after="0.2cm"><fo:basic-link internal-destination="W0111-00-0035-mi-0425" color="#0a0c75">25</fo:basic-link> </fo:inline> <fo:inline font-style="italic">Stipulatio <fo:inline font-weight="normal">s</fo:inline>ine cau<fo:inline font-weight="normal">s</fo:inline>a, an <fo:inline font-weight="normal">s</fo:inline>it inefficax.</fo:inline></fo:block>
<fo:block id="W0111-00-0031-it-0631" text-align="justify" start-indent="16pt" space-before="0.2cm" space-after="0.2cm"><fo:inline> </fo:inline><fo:inline space-before="0.2cm" space-after="0.2cm"><fo:basic-link internal-destination="W0111-00-0036-mi-0427" color="#0a0c75">26</fo:basic-link> </fo:inline> <fo:inline font-style="italic">Modus appo<fo:inline font-weight="normal">s</fo:inline>itus in donatione in fauorẽ tertij, cuius<fo:inline> </fo:inline>contemplatione e<fo:inline font-weight="normal">s</fo:inline>t appo<fo:inline font-weight="normal">s</fo:inline>itus, an reuocari po<fo:inline font-weight="normal">s</fo:inline>sit.</fo:inline></fo:block>
<fo:block id="W0111-00-0031-it-0632" text-align="justify" start-indent="16pt" space-before="0.2cm" space-after="0.2cm"><fo:inline> </fo:inline><fo:inline space-before="0.2cm" space-after="0.2cm"><fo:basic-link internal-destination="W0111-00-0036-mi-0429" color="#0a0c75">27</fo:basic-link> </fo:inline> <fo:inline font-style="italic">Permutatio <fo:inline font-weight="normal">s</fo:inline>i fiat <fo:inline font-weight="normal">s</fo:inline>olis verbis, vtrum quilibet ex contrahentibus pœnitere &amp; à contractu di<fo:inline font-weight="normal">s</fo:inline>cedere<fo:inline> </fo:inline>po<fo:inline font-weight="normal">s</fo:inline>sit.</fo:inline></fo:block>
<fo:block id="W0111-00-0031-it-0633" text-align="justify" start-indent="16pt" space-before="0.2cm" space-after="0.2cm"><fo:inline> </fo:inline><fo:inline space-before="0.2cm" space-after="0.2cm"><fo:basic-link internal-destination="W0111-00-0036-mi-042b" color="#0a0c75">28</fo:basic-link> </fo:inline> <fo:inline font-style="italic">Inquilinus an po<fo:inline font-weight="normal">s</fo:inline>sit excipere de pacto inito cũ empto<fo:inline> </fo:inline>re rei locatæ inter eum &amp; venditorem.</fo:inline></fo:block>
<fo:block id="W0111-00-0031-it-0634" text-align="justify" start-indent="16pt" space-before="0.2cm" space-after="0.2cm"><fo:inline> </fo:inline><fo:inline space-before="0.2cm" space-after="0.2cm"><fo:basic-link internal-destination="W0111-00-0036-mi-042c" color="#0a0c75">29</fo:basic-link> </fo:inline> <fo:inline font-style="italic">Stipulatio an obliget <fo:inline font-weight="normal">s</fo:inline>i incontinenti non re<fo:inline font-weight="normal">s</fo:inline>pondeat.</fo:inline></fo:block>
<fo:block id="W0111-00-0031-it-0635" text-align="justify" start-indent="16pt" space-before="0.2cm" space-after="0.2cm"><fo:inline> </fo:inline><fo:inline space-before="0.2cm" space-after="0.2cm"><fo:basic-link internal-destination="W0111-00-0037-mi-042e" color="#0a0c75">30</fo:basic-link> </fo:inline> <fo:inline font-style="italic">Stipulatio an valeat inter ab<fo:inline font-weight="normal">s</fo:inline>entes,</fo:inline></fo:block>
<fo:block id="W0111-00-0031-it-0636" text-align="justify" start-indent="16pt" space-before="0.2cm" space-after="0.2cm"><fo:inline> </fo:inline><fo:inline space-before="0.2cm" space-after="0.2cm"><fo:basic-link internal-destination="W0111-00-0037-mi-0430" color="#0a0c75">31</fo:basic-link> </fo:inline> <fo:inline font-style="italic">Actio de dote <fo:inline font-weight="normal">s</fo:inline>oluto matrimonio cui competat, patrine, an filiæ?</fo:inline></fo:block>
<fo:block id="W0111-00-0031-it-0637" text-align="justify" start-indent="16pt" space-before="0.2cm" space-after="0.2cm"><fo:inline> </fo:inline><fo:inline space-before="0.2cm" space-after="0.2cm"><fo:basic-link internal-destination="W0111-00-0037-mi-0432" color="#0a0c75">32</fo:basic-link> </fo:inline> <fo:inline font-style="italic">Dos, quo ca<fo:inline font-weight="normal">s</fo:inline>u con<fo:inline font-weight="normal">s</fo:inline>tante matrimonio non repetatur<fo:inline> </fo:inline>abvxore, <fo:inline font-weight="normal">s</fo:inline>ivir eius vergat ad inopiam.</fo:inline></fo:block>
<fo:block id="W0111-00-0031-it-0638" text-align="justify" start-indent="16pt" space-before="0.2cm" space-after="0.2cm"><fo:inline> </fo:inline><fo:inline space-before="0.2cm" space-after="0.2cm"><fo:basic-link internal-destination="W0111-00-0037-mi-0435" color="#0a0c75">33</fo:basic-link> </fo:inline> <fo:inline font-style="italic">Actio hypothecaria tam in debitore, quàm in alio ter<fo:inline> </fo:inline>tio retinente rem hypothecatam, quanto tempore præ<fo:inline font-weight="normal">s</fo:inline>cribitur.</fo:inline></fo:block>
<fo:block id="W0111-00-0031-it-0639" text-align="justify" start-indent="16pt" space-before="0.2cm" space-after="0.2cm"><fo:inline> </fo:inline><fo:inline space-before="0.2cm" space-after="0.2cm"><fo:basic-link internal-destination="W0111-00-0037-mi-0437" color="#0a0c75">34</fo:basic-link> </fo:inline> <fo:inline font-style="italic">Actor <fo:inline font-weight="normal">s</fo:inline>i petit plus debite, qua pœna puniatur. Et<fo:inline> </fo:inline>quid de actore contumace, <fo:inline font-weight="normal">s</fo:inline>i ex actis de iniu<fo:inline font-weight="normal">s</fo:inline>titia<fo:inline> </fo:inline>rei appareat.</fo:inline></fo:block>
<fo:block id="W0111-00-0031-it-063a" text-align="justify" start-indent="16pt" space-before="0.2cm" space-after="0.2cm"><fo:inline> </fo:inline><fo:inline space-before="0.2cm" space-after="0.2cm"><fo:basic-link internal-destination="W0111-00-0037-mi-0439" color="#0a0c75">35</fo:basic-link> </fo:inline> <fo:inline font-style="italic">Accu<fo:inline font-weight="normal">s</fo:inline>atio <fo:inline font-weight="normal">s</fo:inline>i fiat, an in eanomen Imperatoris apponi debeat.</fo:inline></fo:block>
<fo:block id="W0111-00-0031-it-063b" text-align="justify" start-indent="16pt" space-before="0.2cm" space-after="0.2cm"><fo:inline> </fo:inline><fo:inline space-before="0.2cm" space-after="0.2cm"><fo:basic-link internal-destination="W0111-00-0037-mi-043b" color="#0a0c75">36</fo:basic-link> </fo:inline> <fo:inline font-style="italic">Damnatus ex contractu, ex quo grauatur infamia,<fo:inline> </fo:inline>an repellatur ab accu<fo:inline font-weight="normal">s</fo:inline>ando.</fo:inline></fo:block>
<fo:block id="W0111-00-0031-it-063c" text-align="justify" start-indent="16pt" space-before="0.2cm" space-after="0.2cm"><fo:inline> </fo:inline><fo:inline space-before="0.2cm" space-after="0.2cm"><fo:basic-link internal-destination="W0111-00-0038-mi-043f" color="#0a0c75">37</fo:basic-link> </fo:inline> <fo:inline font-style="italic">Damnatus in metallum, vel deportatus, an po<fo:inline font-weight="normal">s</fo:inline>sit ex<fo:inline> </fo:inline>traneum accu<fo:inline font-weight="normal">s</fo:inline>are. Et quid dicendum de condemna<fo:inline> </fo:inline>to ad mortem.</fo:inline></fo:block>
<fo:block id="W0111-00-0031-it-063d" text-align="justify" start-indent="16pt" space-before="0.2cm" space-after="0.2cm"><fo:inline> </fo:inline><fo:inline space-before="0.2cm" space-after="0.2cm"><fo:basic-link internal-destination="W0111-00-0038-mi-0441" color="#0a0c75">38</fo:basic-link> </fo:inline> <fo:inline font-style="italic">Accu<fo:inline font-weight="normal">s</fo:inline>atus decrimine, an, &amp; quando repellatur à te<fo:inline> </fo:inline><fo:inline font-weight="normal">s</fo:inline>timonio,</fo:inline></fo:block>
<fo:block id="W0111-00-0031-it-063e" text-align="justify" start-indent="16pt" space-before="0.2cm" space-after="0.2cm"><fo:inline> </fo:inline><fo:inline space-before="0.2cm" space-after="0.2cm"><fo:basic-link internal-destination="W0111-00-0038-mi-0443" color="#0a0c75">39</fo:basic-link> </fo:inline> <fo:inline font-style="italic">Accu<fo:inline font-weight="normal">s</fo:inline>atus de crimine quando non po<fo:inline font-weight="normal">s</fo:inline>it e<fo:inline font-weight="normal">s</fo:inline><fo:inline font-weight="normal">s</fo:inline>e procurator.</fo:inline></fo:block>
<fo:block id="W0111-00-0031-it-063f" text-align="justify" start-indent="16pt" space-before="0.2cm" space-after="0.2cm"><fo:inline> </fo:inline><fo:inline space-before="0.2cm" space-after="0.2cm"><fo:basic-link internal-destination="W0111-00-0038-mi-0445" color="#0a0c75">40</fo:basic-link> </fo:inline> <fo:inline font-style="italic">Accu<fo:inline font-weight="normal">s</fo:inline>atus<fo:inline font-weight="normal">s</fo:inline>i <fo:inline font-weight="normal">s</fo:inline>eip<fo:inline font-weight="normal">s</fo:inline>um occidat, quid requiratur ad hoc,<fo:inline> </fo:inline>vt eius bona confi<fo:inline font-weight="normal">s</fo:inline>cari po<fo:inline font-weight="normal">s</fo:inline>int.</fo:inline></fo:block>
<fo:block id="W0111-00-0031-it-0640" text-align="justify" start-indent="16pt" space-before="0.2cm" space-after="0.2cm"><fo:inline> </fo:inline><fo:inline space-before="0.2cm" space-after="0.2cm"><fo:basic-link internal-destination="W0111-00-0038-mi-0447" color="#0a0c75">41</fo:basic-link> </fo:inline> <fo:inline font-style="italic">Adama<fo:inline font-weight="normal">s</fo:inline>ia quo ca<fo:inline font-weight="normal">s</fo:inline>u puniatur. Et quid dicendum de<fo:inline> </fo:inline>concubina clerici, religio<fo:inline font-weight="normal">s</fo:inline>i, vel vxorati.</fo:inline></fo:block>
<fo:block id="W0111-00-0031-it-0641" text-align="justify" start-indent="16pt" space-before="0.2cm" space-after="0.2cm"><fo:inline> </fo:inline><fo:inline space-before="0.2cm" space-after="0.2cm"><fo:basic-link internal-destination="W0111-00-0038-mi-0449" color="#0a0c75">42</fo:basic-link> </fo:inline> <fo:inline font-style="italic">Adulterium quis accu<fo:inline font-weight="normal">s</fo:inline>are po<fo:inline font-weight="normal">s</fo:inline>sit, o<fo:inline font-weight="normal">s</fo:inline>tenditur.</fo:inline></fo:block>
<fo:block id="W0111-00-0031-it-0642" text-align="justify" start-indent="16pt" space-before="0.2cm" space-after="0.2cm"><fo:inline> </fo:inline><fo:inline space-before="0.2cm" space-after="0.2cm"><fo:basic-link internal-destination="W0111-00-0038-mi-044b" color="#0a0c75">43</fo:basic-link> </fo:inline> <fo:inline font-style="italic">Adulterij pœna quæ <fo:inline font-weight="normal">s</fo:inline>it, recen<fo:inline font-weight="normal">s</fo:inline>etur.</fo:inline></fo:block>
<fo:block id="W0111-00-0031-it-0643" text-align="justify" start-indent="16pt" space-before="0.2cm" space-after="0.2cm"><fo:inline> </fo:inline><fo:inline space-before="0.2cm" space-after="0.2cm"><fo:basic-link internal-destination="W0111-00-0039-mi-044d" color="#0a0c75">44</fo:basic-link> </fo:inline> <fo:inline font-style="italic">Adulterium quando dicatur quis committere.</fo:inline></fo:block>
<fo:block id="W0111-00-0031-it-0644" text-align="justify" start-indent="16pt" space-before="0.2cm" space-after="0.2cm"><fo:inline> </fo:inline><fo:inline space-before="0.2cm" space-after="0.2cm"><fo:basic-link internal-destination="W0111-00-0039-mi-044f" color="#0a0c75">45</fo:basic-link> </fo:inline> <fo:inline font-style="italic">Aduocatus qui <fo:inline font-weight="normal">s</fo:inline>e obligauit cau<fo:inline font-weight="normal">s</fo:inline>am de<fo:inline font-weight="normal">s</fo:inline>endere, ad<fo:inline> </fo:inline>quid teneatur.</fo:inline></fo:block>
<fo:block id="W0111-00-0031-it-0645" text-align="justify" start-indent="16pt" space-before="0.2cm" space-after="0.2cm"><fo:inline> </fo:inline><fo:inline space-before="0.2cm" space-after="0.2cm"><fo:basic-link internal-destination="W0111-00-0039-mi-0451" color="#0a0c75">46</fo:basic-link> </fo:inline> <fo:inline font-style="italic">Aduocatus con<fo:inline font-weight="normal">s</fo:inline>ulens clientulo vt producat in cau<fo:inline font-weight="normal">s</fo:inline>æ<fo:inline> </fo:inline>fal<fo:inline font-weight="normal">s</fo:inline>a in<fo:inline font-weight="normal">s</fo:inline>trumenta, qua pœna puniatur.</fo:inline></fo:block>
<fo:block id="W0111-00-0031-it-0646" text-align="justify" start-indent="16pt" space-before="0.2cm" space-after="0.2cm"><fo:inline> </fo:inline><fo:inline space-before="0.2cm" space-after="0.2cm"><fo:basic-link internal-destination="W0111-00-0039-mi-0453" color="#0a0c75">47</fo:basic-link> </fo:inline> <fo:inline font-style="italic">Aduocatus quòd non teneatur iurare <fo:inline font-weight="normal">s</fo:inline>e foturum iu<fo:inline font-weight="normal">s</fo:inline>tam cau<fo:inline font-weight="normal">s</fo:inline>am, <fo:inline font-weight="normal">s</fo:inline>ed quid facere debeat, o<fo:inline font-weight="normal">s</fo:inline>tenditur.</fo:inline></fo:block>
<fo:block id="W0111-00-0031-it-0647" text-align="justify" start-indent="16pt" space-before="0.2cm" space-after="0.2cm"><fo:inline> </fo:inline><fo:inline space-before="0.2cm" space-after="0.2cm"><fo:basic-link internal-destination="W0111-00-0039-mi-0455" color="#0a0c75">48</fo:basic-link> </fo:inline> <fo:inline font-style="italic">Aduocati <fo:inline font-weight="normal">s</fo:inline>alarium qualiter quis <fo:inline font-weight="normal">s</fo:inline>oluere debeat.</fo:inline></fo:block>
<fo:block id="W0111-00-0031-it-0648" text-align="justify" start-indent="16pt" space-before="0.2cm" space-after="0.2cm"><fo:inline> </fo:inline><fo:inline space-before="0.2cm" space-after="0.2cm"><fo:basic-link internal-destination="W0111-00-0039-mi-0457" color="#0a0c75">49</fo:basic-link> </fo:inline> <fo:inline font-style="italic">Affinitas quod habeat gradus palam fit.</fo:inline></fo:block>
<fo:block id="W0111-00-0031-it-0649" text-align="justify" start-indent="16pt" space-before="0.2cm" space-after="0.2cm"><fo:inline> </fo:inline><fo:inline space-before="0.2cm" space-after="0.2cm"><fo:basic-link internal-destination="W0111-00-0039-mi-0459" color="#0a0c75">50</fo:basic-link> </fo:inline> <fo:inline font-style="italic">Affinitas quod etiam <fo:inline font-weight="normal">s</fo:inline>ine matrimonio contrahatur.</fo:inline></fo:block>
<fo:block id="W0111-00-0031-it-064a" text-align="justify" start-indent="16pt" space-before="0.2cm" space-after="0.2cm"><fo:inline> </fo:inline><fo:inline space-before="0.2cm" space-after="0.2cm"><fo:basic-link internal-destination="W0111-00-0039-mi-045b" color="#0a0c75">51</fo:basic-link> </fo:inline> <fo:inline font-style="italic">Agenti interdicto recuperandæ po<fo:inline font-weight="normal">s</fo:inline><fo:inline font-weight="normal">s</fo:inline>e<fo:inline font-weight="normal">s</fo:inline>sionis quando<fo:inline> </fo:inline>exceptio dominij ob<fo:inline font-weight="normal">s</fo:inline>ter.</fo:inline></fo:block>
<fo:block id="W0111-00-0031-it-064b" text-align="justify" start-indent="16pt" space-before="0.2cm" space-after="0.2cm"><fo:inline> </fo:inline><fo:inline space-before="0.2cm" space-after="0.2cm"><fo:basic-link internal-destination="W0111-00-0039-mi-045d" color="#0a0c75">52</fo:basic-link> </fo:inline> <fo:inline font-style="italic">Amicus quod po<fo:inline font-weight="normal">s</fo:inline>sit e<fo:inline font-weight="normal">s</fo:inline><fo:inline font-weight="normal">s</fo:inline>e te<fo:inline font-weight="normal">s</fo:inline>tis etiãm cau<fo:inline font-weight="normal">s</fo:inline>a <fo:inline font-weight="normal">s</fo:inline>ocietatis.</fo:inline></fo:block>
<fo:block id="W0111-00-0031-it-064c" text-align="justify" start-indent="16pt" space-before="0.2cm" space-after="0.2cm"><fo:inline> </fo:inline><fo:inline space-before="0.2cm" space-after="0.2cm"><fo:basic-link internal-destination="W0111-00-0040-mi-045f" color="#0a0c75">53</fo:basic-link> </fo:inline> <fo:inline font-style="italic">Alienari an po<fo:inline font-weight="normal">s</fo:inline>sint etiam donata à Principe.</fo:inline></fo:block>
<fo:block id="W0111-00-0031-it-064d" text-align="justify" start-indent="16pt" space-before="0.2cm" space-after="0.2cm"><fo:inline> </fo:inline><fo:inline space-before="0.2cm" space-after="0.2cm"><fo:basic-link internal-destination="W0111-00-0040-mi-0461" color="#0a0c75">54</fo:basic-link> </fo:inline> <fo:inline font-style="italic">Alienata in quibus ca<fo:inline font-weight="normal">s</fo:inline>ibus reuocari po<fo:inline font-weight="normal">s</fo:inline>sint etiam<fo:inline> </fo:inline>ante <fo:inline font-weight="normal">s</fo:inline>ententiam.</fo:inline></fo:block>
<fo:block id="W0111-00-0031-it-064e" text-align="justify" start-indent="16pt" space-before="0.2cm" space-after="0.2cm"><fo:inline> </fo:inline><fo:inline space-before="0.2cm" space-after="0.2cm"><fo:basic-link internal-destination="W0111-00-0040-mi-0463" color="#0a0c75">55</fo:basic-link> </fo:inline> <fo:inline font-style="italic">Alienatione vei iudicij mutandi cau<fo:inline font-weight="normal">s</fo:inline>a facta per detentatorem vel po<fo:inline font-weight="normal">s</fo:inline><fo:inline font-weight="normal">s</fo:inline>e<fo:inline font-weight="normal">s</fo:inline><fo:inline font-weight="normal">s</fo:inline>orẽ rei &amp; <fo:inline font-weight="normal">s</fo:inline>i de iure ciuili do<fo:inline> </fo:inline>minus propo<fo:inline font-weight="normal">s</fo:inline>ita actione contra alienantem, &amp; ab<fo:inline> </fo:inline>eo æ<fo:inline font-weight="normal">s</fo:inline>timatione recepta poterat nihilominus vendicarerem à po<fo:inline font-weight="normal">s</fo:inline><fo:inline font-weight="normal">s</fo:inline>e<fo:inline font-weight="normal">s</fo:inline><fo:inline font-weight="normal">s</fo:inline>ore, quòd tamen de iure regio cõ<fo:inline> </fo:inline><fo:inline font-weight="normal">s</fo:inline>ecuta æ<fo:inline font-weight="normal">s</fo:inline>timatione nihil amplius petere po<fo:inline font-weight="normal">s</fo:inline>sit, o<fo:inline font-weight="normal">s</fo:inline>tẽ<fo:inline> </fo:inline>ditur.</fo:inline></fo:block>
<fo:block id="W0111-00-0031-it-064f" text-align="justify" start-indent="16pt" space-before="0.2cm" space-after="0.2cm"><fo:inline> </fo:inline><fo:inline space-before="0.2cm" space-after="0.2cm"><fo:basic-link internal-destination="W0111-00-0040-mi-0465" color="#0a0c75">56</fo:basic-link> </fo:inline> <fo:inline font-style="italic">Leges. C. Ne liceat potentioribus. &amp; <fo:inline font-weight="normal">s</fo:inline>i locum habeãt<fo:inline> </fo:inline>tam in actore quãm reo, quòd tamen de iure regni<fo:inline> </fo:inline>in actore <fo:inline font-weight="normal">s</fo:inline>olùm locum habeant manife<fo:inline font-weight="normal">s</fo:inline>tum fit.</fo:inline></fo:block>
<fo:block id="W0111-00-0031-it-0650" text-align="justify" start-indent="16pt" space-before="0.2cm" space-after="0.2cm"><fo:inline> </fo:inline><fo:inline space-before="0.2cm" space-after="0.2cm"><fo:basic-link internal-destination="W0111-00-0040-mi-0467" color="#0a0c75">57</fo:basic-link> </fo:inline> <fo:inline font-style="italic">Annui reditus redimibiles qualiter con<fo:inline font-weight="normal">s</fo:inline>titui po<fo:inline font-weight="normal">s</fo:inline>int.</fo:inline></fo:block>
<fo:block id="W0111-00-0031-it-0651" text-align="justify" start-indent="16pt" space-before="0.2cm" space-after="0.2cm"><fo:inline> </fo:inline><fo:inline space-before="0.2cm" space-after="0.2cm"><fo:basic-link internal-destination="W0111-00-0040-mi-0469" color="#0a0c75">58</fo:basic-link> </fo:inline> <fo:inline font-style="italic">Appellatio à diffinitiua v<fo:inline font-weight="normal">s</fo:inline>que ad quot dies interponi<fo:inline> </fo:inline>poßit.</fo:inline></fo:block>
<fo:block id="W0111-00-0031-it-0652" text-align="justify" start-indent="16pt" space-before="0.2cm" space-after="0.2cm"><fo:inline> </fo:inline><fo:inline space-before="0.2cm" space-after="0.2cm"><fo:basic-link internal-destination="W0111-00-0041-mi-046b" color="#0a0c75">59</fo:basic-link> </fo:inline> <fo:inline font-style="italic">Apo<fo:inline font-weight="normal">s</fo:inline>toli intra quot dies <fo:inline font-weight="normal">s</fo:inline>int præ<fo:inline font-weight="normal">s</fo:inline>tandi, &amp; à que<fo:inline> </fo:inline>tempore currere incipiant.</fo:inline></fo:block>
<fo:block id="W0111-00-0031-it-0653" text-align="justify" start-indent="16pt" space-before="0.2cm" space-after="0.2cm"><fo:inline> </fo:inline><fo:inline space-before="0.2cm" space-after="0.2cm"><fo:basic-link internal-destination="W0111-00-0041-mi-046d" color="#0a0c75">60</fo:basic-link> </fo:inline> <fo:inline font-style="italic">Appellatio extranei an <fo:inline font-weight="normal">s</fo:inline>u<fo:inline font-weight="normal">s</fo:inline>pendat <fo:inline font-weight="normal">s</fo:inline>ententiam <fo:inline font-weight="normal">s</fo:inline>anguinis contra aliquem latam, illo renitente, &amp; <fo:inline font-weight="normal">s</fo:inline>en<fo:inline> </fo:inline>tentiam con<fo:inline font-weight="normal">s</fo:inline>entiente.</fo:inline></fo:block>
<fo:block id="W0111-00-0031-it-0654" text-align="justify" start-indent="16pt" space-before="0.2cm" space-after="0.2cm"><fo:inline> </fo:inline><fo:inline space-before="0.2cm" space-after="0.2cm"><fo:basic-link internal-destination="W0111-00-0041-mi-046f" color="#0a0c75">61</fo:basic-link> </fo:inline> <fo:inline font-style="italic">Apellationes in iudicio, <fo:inline font-weight="normal">s</fo:inline>eu articulo po<fo:inline font-weight="normal">s</fo:inline><fo:inline font-weight="normal">s</fo:inline>e<fo:inline font-weight="normal">s</fo:inline><fo:inline font-weight="normal">s</fo:inline>orio quot<fo:inline> </fo:inline>admittontur.</fo:inline></fo:block>
<fo:block id="W0111-00-0031-it-0655" text-align="justify" start-indent="16pt" space-before="0.2cm" space-after="0.2cm"><fo:inline> </fo:inline><fo:inline space-before="0.2cm" space-after="0.2cm"><fo:basic-link internal-destination="W0111-00-0041-mi-0471" color="#0a0c75">62</fo:basic-link> </fo:inline> <fo:inline font-style="italic">Appellatio quãdo fieripoßit nõ gradatim, <fo:inline font-weight="normal">s</fo:inline>ed omi<fo:inline font-weight="normal">s</fo:inline><fo:inline font-weight="normal">s</fo:inline>o medio. Et quid dicendum in <fo:inline font-weight="normal">s</fo:inline>ententia Comitris.</fo:inline></fo:block>
<fo:block id="W0111-00-0032-it-0656" text-align="justify" start-indent="16pt" space-before="0.2cm" space-after="0.2cm"><fo:inline font-style="normal" id="W0111-00-0032-pb-0406"/><fo:inline role="W0111-00-0032-pb-0406" font-style="normal" font-weight="bold" font-size="12pt">[Fol.4r]</fo:inline><fo:inline> </fo:inline><fo:inline space-before="0.2cm" space-after="0.2cm"><fo:basic-link internal-destination="W0111-00-0041-mi-0473" color="#0a0c75">63</fo:basic-link> </fo:inline> <fo:inline font-style="italic">Appellatio <fo:inline font-weight="normal">s</fo:inline>i fiat ad æqualẽ iudicẽ qui iudicauit, ad<fo:inline> </fo:inline>quẽ iudicẽ remittendus <fo:inline font-weight="normal">s</fo:inline>it appellãs, o<fo:inline font-weight="normal">s</fo:inline>tenditur.</fo:inline></fo:block>
<fo:block id="W0111-00-0032-it-0657" text-align="justify" start-indent="16pt" space-before="0.2cm" space-after="0.2cm"><fo:inline> </fo:inline><fo:inline space-before="0.2cm" space-after="0.2cm"><fo:basic-link internal-destination="W0111-00-0041-mi-0475" color="#0a0c75">64</fo:basic-link> </fo:inline> <fo:inline font-style="italic">Apellationis iudex <fo:inline font-weight="normal">s</fo:inline>i <fo:inline font-weight="normal">s</fo:inline>ententiã confirmet, quòd remittenda <fo:inline font-weight="normal">s</fo:inline>it executio iudici à quo.</fo:inline></fo:block>
<fo:block id="W0111-00-0032-it-0658" text-align="justify" start-indent="16pt" space-before="0.2cm" space-after="0.2cm"><fo:inline> </fo:inline><fo:inline space-before="0.2cm" space-after="0.2cm"><fo:basic-link internal-destination="W0111-00-0041-mi-0477" color="#0a0c75">65</fo:basic-link> </fo:inline> <fo:inline font-style="italic">Aqua <fo:inline font-weight="normal">s</fo:inline>i na<fo:inline font-weight="normal">s</fo:inline>catur in meo <fo:inline font-weight="normal">s</fo:inline>olo, &amp; decurrat ad partem inferiorem ad prata inferiora <fo:inline font-weight="normal">s</fo:inline>ine facto domi<fo:inline> </fo:inline>ni inferioris &amp;c. vtrũ eã diuertere poßim ad meã<fo:inline> </fo:inline>vtilitatem. Et quanto tẽpore dominus inferior <fo:inline font-weight="normal">s</fo:inline>eruitutem illius aquæ acquirere po<fo:inline font-weight="normal">s</fo:inline>sit.</fo:inline></fo:block>
<fo:block id="W0111-00-0032-it-0659" text-align="justify" start-indent="16pt" space-before="0.2cm" space-after="0.2cm"><fo:inline> </fo:inline><fo:inline space-before="0.2cm" space-after="0.2cm"><fo:basic-link internal-destination="W0111-00-0042-mi-0479" color="#0a0c75">66</fo:basic-link> </fo:inline> <fo:inline font-style="italic">Arbiter <fo:inline font-weight="normal">s</fo:inline>i efficiatur monachus, &amp; ingrediatur mo<fo:inline> </fo:inline>na<fo:inline font-weight="normal">s</fo:inline>terium, an etiam de licentia abbatis <fo:inline font-weight="normal">s</fo:inline>ententiam<fo:inline> </fo:inline>proferre poßit.</fo:inline></fo:block>
<fo:block id="W0111-00-0032-it-065a" text-align="justify" start-indent="16pt" space-before="0.2cm" space-after="0.2cm"><fo:inline> </fo:inline><fo:inline space-before="0.2cm" space-after="0.2cm"><fo:basic-link internal-destination="W0111-00-0042-mi-047b" color="#0a0c75">67</fo:basic-link> </fo:inline> <fo:inline font-style="italic">Arbiter electus <fo:inline font-weight="normal">s</fo:inline>uper diuer<fo:inline font-weight="normal">s</fo:inline>as cau<fo:inline font-weight="normal">s</fo:inline>as, an teneatur<fo:inline> </fo:inline><fo:inline font-weight="normal">s</fo:inline>uper oẽs, &amp; nõ in vna re <fo:inline font-weight="normal">s</fo:inline>ola<fo:inline font-weight="normal">s</fo:inline>entẽtiam proferre.</fo:inline></fo:block>
<fo:block id="W0111-00-0032-it-065b" text-align="justify" start-indent="16pt" space-before="0.2cm" space-after="0.2cm"><fo:inline> </fo:inline><fo:inline space-before="0.2cm" space-after="0.2cm"><fo:basic-link internal-destination="W0111-00-0042-mi-047d" color="#0a0c75">68</fo:basic-link> </fo:inline> <fo:inline font-style="italic">Arbitriquando per iudicem ordinarium tertium eligere compellantur.</fo:inline></fo:block>
<fo:block id="W0111-00-0032-it-065c" text-align="justify" start-indent="16pt" space-before="0.2cm" space-after="0.2cm"><fo:inline> </fo:inline><fo:inline space-before="0.2cm" space-after="0.2cm"><fo:basic-link internal-destination="W0111-00-0042-mi-047f" color="#0a0c75">69</fo:basic-link> </fo:inline> <fo:inline font-style="italic">Auusin <fo:inline font-weight="normal">s</fo:inline>ucceßione neptis, quòd etiã fratres vtrin<fo:inline> </fo:inline>coniunctos excludat.</fo:inline></fo:block>
<fo:block id="W0111-00-0032-it-065d" text-align="justify" start-indent="16pt" space-before="0.2cm" space-after="0.2cm"><fo:inline> </fo:inline><fo:inline space-before="0.2cm" space-after="0.2cm"><fo:basic-link internal-destination="W0111-00-0042-mi-0481" color="#0a0c75">70</fo:basic-link> </fo:inline> <fo:inline font-style="italic">Authoritas Principis in confirmatione maioratus,<fo:inline> </fo:inline>qualiter interuenire debeat, o<fo:inline font-weight="normal">s</fo:inline>tenditur.</fo:inline></fo:block>
<fo:block id="W0111-00-0032-it-065e" text-align="justify" start-indent="16pt" space-before="0.2cm" space-after="0.2cm"><fo:inline> </fo:inline><fo:inline space-before="0.2cm" space-after="0.2cm"><fo:basic-link internal-destination="W0111-00-0042-mi-0482" color="#0a0c75">71</fo:basic-link> </fo:inline> <fo:inline font-style="italic">Arma quæ deferrilicent, tam die quam nocte. Et ꝙ<fo:inline> </fo:inline>vltra certã horã nocte nõ liceat, ni<fo:inline font-weight="normal">s</fo:inline>i portetur luniẽ.</fo:inline></fo:block>
<fo:block id="W0111-00-0032-it-065f" text-align="justify" start-indent="16pt" space-before="0.2cm" space-after="0.2cm"><fo:inline> </fo:inline><fo:inline space-before="0.2cm" space-after="0.2cm"><fo:basic-link internal-destination="W0111-00-0042-mi-0483" color="#0a0c75">72</fo:basic-link> </fo:inline> <fo:inline font-style="italic">Armorum prohibitio <fo:inline font-weight="normal">s</fo:inline>i fiat quòd tam de offen<fo:inline font-weight="normal">s</fo:inline>ibili<fo:inline> </fo:inline>bus, quàm de defen<fo:inline font-weight="normal">s</fo:inline>ibilibus intelligatur.</fo:inline></fo:block>
</fo:block>
</fo:block>
<fo:block text-align="justify" font-size="16pt" font-weight="bold" space-before="20pt" text-indent="0em" keep-with-next="always"><fo:inline> </fo:inline>A.</fo:block>
