<fo:block id="W0111-00-0076-it-0736" text-align="justify" start-indent="16pt" space-before="0.2cm" space-after="0.2cm"><fo:inline> </fo:inline><fo:inline space-before="0.2cm" space-after="0.2cm"><fo:basic-link internal-destination="W0111-00-0080-mi-0625" color="#0a0c75">22</fo:basic-link> </fo:inline> <fo:inline font-style="italic">Instrumenta qualiter in cau<fo:inline font-weight="normal">s</fo:inline>a per actorem &amp; reum<fo:inline> </fo:inline>produci debeant.</fo:inline></fo:block>
<fo:block id="W0111-00-0076-it-0737" text-align="justify" start-indent="16pt" space-before="0.2cm" space-after="0.2cm"><fo:inline> </fo:inline><fo:inline space-before="0.2cm" space-after="0.2cm"><fo:basic-link internal-destination="W0111-00-0080-mi-0627" color="#0a0c75">23</fo:basic-link> </fo:inline> <fo:inline font-style="italic">Iuramẽtum quod in contractibus, inquibus e<fo:inline font-weight="normal">s</fo:inline>t nece<fo:inline font-weight="normal">s</fo:inline><fo:inline font-weight="normal">s</fo:inline>arium ad eorum validationem, apponi poßit.</fo:inline></fo:block>
<fo:block id="W0111-00-0076-it-0738" text-align="justify" start-indent="16pt" space-before="0.2cm" space-after="0.2cm"><fo:inline> </fo:inline><fo:inline space-before="0.2cm" space-after="0.2cm"><fo:basic-link internal-destination="W0111-00-0081-mi-0629" color="#0a0c75">24</fo:basic-link> </fo:inline> <fo:inline font-style="italic">Iurare <fo:inline font-weight="normal">s</fo:inline>uper altare, nec <fo:inline font-weight="normal">s</fo:inline>upra <fo:inline font-weight="normal">s</fo:inline>epulihrum <fo:inline font-weight="normal">s</fo:inline>ancti ali<fo:inline> </fo:inline>cuius. &amp;c. quod non liceat.</fo:inline></fo:block>
<fo:block id="W0111-00-0076-it-0739" text-align="justify" start-indent="16pt" space-before="0.2cm" space-after="0.2cm"><fo:inline> </fo:inline><fo:inline space-before="0.2cm" space-after="0.2cm"><fo:basic-link internal-destination="W0111-00-0081-mi-062b" color="#0a0c75">25</fo:basic-link> </fo:inline> <fo:inline font-style="italic">Iuramentum in accu<fo:inline font-weight="normal">s</fo:inline>atione quod <fo:inline font-weight="normal">s</fo:inline>it nece<fo:inline font-weight="normal">s</fo:inline><fo:inline font-weight="normal">s</fo:inline>arium.</fo:inline></fo:block>
<fo:block id="W0111-00-0076-it-073a" text-align="justify" start-indent="16pt" space-before="0.2cm" space-after="0.2cm"><fo:inline> </fo:inline><fo:inline space-before="0.2cm" space-after="0.2cm"><fo:basic-link internal-destination="W0111-00-0081-mi-062d" color="#0a0c75">26</fo:basic-link> </fo:inline> <fo:inline font-style="italic">Iuramentum culũniæ quod releuet à calumnia præ<fo:inline font-weight="normal">s</fo:inline>umpta non autem à temeritate.</fo:inline></fo:block>
<fo:block id="W0111-00-0076-it-073b" text-align="justify" start-indent="16pt" space-before="0.2cm" space-after="0.2cm"><fo:inline> </fo:inline><fo:inline space-before="0.2cm" space-after="0.2cm"><fo:basic-link internal-destination="W0111-00-0081-mi-062f" color="#0a0c75">27</fo:basic-link> </fo:inline> <fo:inline font-style="italic">Iuramentum delatum ab uno ex correis, quando alijs<fo:inline> </fo:inline>noceat.</fo:inline></fo:block>
<fo:block id="W0111-00-0076-it-073c" text-align="justify" start-indent="16pt" space-before="0.2cm" space-after="0.2cm"><fo:inline> </fo:inline><fo:inline space-before="0.2cm" space-after="0.2cm"><fo:basic-link internal-destination="W0111-00-0081-mi-0631" color="#0a0c75">28</fo:basic-link> </fo:inline> <fo:inline font-style="italic">Iuramentum delatum in actione populari in defectum probatinis, an, &amp; quando alijs de populo<fo:inline> </fo:inline>præiudicet.</fo:inline></fo:block>
<fo:block id="W0111-00-0076-it-073d" text-align="justify" start-indent="16pt" space-before="0.2cm" space-after="0.2cm"><fo:inline> </fo:inline><fo:inline space-before="0.2cm" space-after="0.2cm"><fo:basic-link internal-destination="W0111-00-0081-mi-0633" color="#0a0c75">29</fo:basic-link> </fo:inline> <fo:inline font-style="italic">Iurisdictio, an &amp; quando conce<fo:inline font-weight="normal">s</fo:inline><fo:inline font-weight="normal">s</fo:inline>o territorio cen<fo:inline font-weight="normal">s</fo:inline>catur<fo:inline> </fo:inline>conce<fo:inline font-weight="normal">s</fo:inline><fo:inline font-weight="normal">s</fo:inline>a.</fo:inline></fo:block>
<fo:block id="W0111-00-0076-it-073e" text-align="justify" start-indent="16pt" space-before="0.2cm" space-after="0.2cm"><fo:inline> </fo:inline><fo:inline space-before="0.2cm" space-after="0.2cm"><fo:basic-link internal-destination="W0111-00-0081-mi-0635" color="#0a0c75">30</fo:basic-link> </fo:inline> <fo:inline font-style="italic">Iurisdictio delegate quod per litis conte<fo:inline font-weight="normal">s</fo:inline>tationem per<fo:inline> </fo:inline>petuetur. Et quid requiratur ad per petuandam. Iu<fo:inline> </fo:inline>dicis delegati iuri<fo:inline font-weight="normal">s</fo:inline>dictionem, o<fo:inline font-weight="normal">s</fo:inline>tenditur.</fo:inline></fo:block>
