<fo:block id="W0111-00-0102-it-07ca" text-align="justify" start-indent="16pt" space-before="0.2cm" space-after="0.2cm"><fo:inline> </fo:inline><fo:inline space-before="0.2cm" space-after="0.2cm"><fo:basic-link internal-destination="W0111-00-0103-mi-0746" color="#0a0c75">6</fo:basic-link> </fo:inline> <fo:inline font-style="italic">Renuntiatio non numeratæ pecuniæ ad hoc quòd præ<fo:inline> </fo:inline>rudicet, <fo:inline font-weight="normal">s</fo:inline>ufficit quod non <fo:inline font-weight="normal">s</fo:inline>it in alia charta.</fo:inline></fo:block>
<fo:block id="W0111-00-0102-it-07cb" text-align="justify" start-indent="16pt" space-before="0.2cm" space-after="0.2cm"><fo:inline> </fo:inline><fo:inline space-before="0.2cm" space-after="0.2cm"><fo:basic-link internal-destination="W0111-00-0103-mi-0748" color="#0a0c75">7</fo:basic-link> </fo:inline> <fo:inline font-style="italic">Repeti quòd poßit id, quod datum e<fo:inline font-weight="normal">s</fo:inline>t iudici vt rectè pro<fo:inline> </fo:inline>nuntiaret.</fo:inline></fo:block>
<fo:block id="W0111-00-0102-it-07cc" text-align="justify" start-indent="16pt" space-before="0.2cm" space-after="0.2cm"><fo:inline> </fo:inline><fo:inline space-before="0.2cm" space-after="0.2cm"><fo:basic-link internal-destination="W0111-00-0103-mi-074a" color="#0a0c75">8</fo:basic-link> </fo:inline> <fo:inline font-style="italic">Replicatio quod <fo:inline font-weight="normal">s</fo:inline>olùm duplicetur, o<fo:inline font-weight="normal">s</fo:inline>tenditur.</fo:inline></fo:block>
<fo:block id="W0111-00-0102-it-07cd" text-align="justify" start-indent="16pt" space-before="0.2cm" space-after="0.2cm"><fo:inline> </fo:inline><fo:inline space-before="0.2cm" space-after="0.2cm"><fo:basic-link internal-destination="W0111-00-0103-mi-074c" color="#0a0c75">9</fo:basic-link> </fo:inline> <fo:inline font-style="italic">Reus &amp; actor quòd eodem tem pore probare debeãt.</fo:inline></fo:block>
<fo:block id="W0111-00-0102-it-07ce" text-align="justify" start-indent="16pt" space-before="0.2cm" space-after="0.2cm"><fo:inline> </fo:inline><fo:inline space-before="0.2cm" space-after="0.2cm"><fo:basic-link internal-destination="W0111-00-0103-mi-074e" color="#0a0c75">10</fo:basic-link> </fo:inline> <fo:inline font-style="italic">Reus cõtumax cùm <fo:inline font-weight="normal">s</fo:inline>it, quòd ad receptionem te<fo:inline font-weight="normal">s</fo:inline>tium,<fo:inline> </fo:inline>etiam lite nou conte<fo:inline font-weight="normal">s</fo:inline>tata, procedatur.</fo:inline></fo:block>
<fo:block id="W0111-00-0102-it-07cf" text-align="justify" start-indent="16pt" space-before="0.2cm" space-after="0.2cm"><fo:inline> </fo:inline><fo:inline space-before="0.2cm" space-after="0.2cm"><fo:basic-link internal-destination="W0111-00-0103-mi-0750" color="#0a0c75">11</fo:basic-link> </fo:inline> <fo:inline font-style="italic">Reus, contra quem actor <fo:inline font-weight="normal">s</fo:inline>uam intentionem vult intẽ<fo:inline> </fo:inline>tare, qui non poßidet bona, <fo:inline font-weight="normal">s</fo:inline>i nõ <fo:inline font-weight="normal">s</fo:inline>ati<fo:inline font-weight="normal">s</fo:inline>det, quòd mitti<fo:inline> </fo:inline>debeat in carcerem, etiam <fo:inline font-weight="normal">s</fo:inline>i propter inopiam non<fo:inline> </fo:inline>præ<fo:inline font-weight="normal">s</fo:inline>titert fideiu<fo:inline font-weight="normal">s</fo:inline><fo:inline font-weight="normal">s</fo:inline>orem.</fo:inline></fo:block>
<fo:block id="W0111-00-0102-it-07d0" text-align="justify" start-indent="16pt" space-before="0.2cm" space-after="0.2cm"><fo:inline> </fo:inline><fo:inline space-before="0.2cm" space-after="0.2cm"><fo:basic-link internal-destination="W0111-00-0103-mi-0752" color="#0a0c75">12</fo:basic-link> </fo:inline> <fo:inline font-style="italic">Reus, qui vult a domicilio ab<fo:inline font-weight="normal">s</fo:inline>entiam facere, vel eundo<fo:inline> </fo:inline>ad nundinas, vel ad alium locum, <fo:inline font-weight="normal">s</fo:inline>i timeat ne ab<fo:inline> </fo:inline>actore impediatur, quid fiat de iure regio, o<fo:inline font-weight="normal">s</fo:inline>tenditur.</fo:inline></fo:block>
<fo:block id="W0111-00-0102-it-07d1" text-align="justify" start-indent="16pt" space-before="0.2cm" space-after="0.2cm"><fo:inline> </fo:inline><fo:inline space-before="0.2cm" space-after="0.2cm"><fo:basic-link internal-destination="W0111-00-0103-mi-0754" color="#0a0c75">13</fo:basic-link> </fo:inline> <fo:inline font-style="italic">Reus <fo:inline font-weight="normal">s</fo:inline>i conueniatur ab aliquo cum aliqua re <fo:inline font-weight="normal">s</fo:inline>ubtracta, <fo:inline font-weight="normal">s</fo:inline>iue res <fo:inline font-weight="normal">s</fo:inline>it mobilis, vel <fo:inline font-weight="normal">s</fo:inline>e mouens, ad quem iu<fo:inline> </fo:inline>dicem remuti debeat, palam fit.</fo:inline></fo:block>
<fo:block id="W0111-00-0102-it-07d2" text-align="justify" start-indent="16pt" space-before="0.2cm" space-after="0.2cm"><fo:inline> </fo:inline><fo:inline space-before="0.2cm" space-after="0.2cm"><fo:basic-link internal-destination="W0111-00-0104-mi-0756" color="#0a0c75">14</fo:basic-link> </fo:inline> <fo:inline font-style="italic">Reus extra domicilium, in quo loco cõuenir debeat.</fo:inline></fo:block>
<fo:block id="W0111-00-0102-it-07d3" text-align="justify" start-indent="16pt" space-before="0.2cm" space-after="0.2cm"><fo:inline> </fo:inline><fo:inline space-before="0.2cm" space-after="0.2cm"><fo:basic-link internal-destination="W0111-00-0104-mi-0757" color="#0a0c75">15</fo:basic-link> </fo:inline> <fo:inline font-style="italic">Reus <fo:inline font-weight="normal">s</fo:inline>i conuineatur ex <fo:inline font-weight="normal">s</fo:inline>ua <fo:inline font-weight="normal">s</fo:inline>ola cõfeßione, <fo:inline font-weight="normal">s</fo:inline>iue det libellum de debito, <fo:inline font-weight="normal">s</fo:inline>iue non, quòd in vtroque ca<fo:inline font-weight="normal">s</fo:inline>u iudex eum condemnare debeat, vt intra decem dies<fo:inline> </fo:inline><fo:inline font-weight="normal">s</fo:inline>oluat.</fo:inline></fo:block>
<fo:block id="W0111-00-0102-it-07d4" text-align="justify" start-indent="16pt" space-before="0.2cm" space-after="0.2cm"><fo:inline> </fo:inline><fo:inline space-before="0.2cm" space-after="0.2cm"><fo:basic-link internal-destination="W0111-00-0104-mi-0759" color="#0a0c75">16</fo:basic-link> </fo:inline> <fo:inline font-style="italic">Reus bonæ fidei po<fo:inline font-weight="normal">s</fo:inline><fo:inline font-weight="normal">s</fo:inline>e<fo:inline font-weight="normal">s</fo:inline><fo:inline font-weight="normal">s</fo:inline>or rei, de qua contenditur in<fo:inline> </fo:inline>iudicio, &amp; <fo:inline font-weight="normal">s</fo:inline>ibi mandatur vt exhibeat, <fo:inline font-weight="normal">s</fo:inline>i habet iu<fo:inline font-weight="normal">s</fo:inline>tam cau<fo:inline font-weight="normal">s</fo:inline>am litigandi, quòd non teneatur exhibere, <fo:inline font-weight="normal">s</fo:inline>i autem non habuit iustam cau<fo:inline font-weight="normal">s</fo:inline>am, quod<fo:inline> </fo:inline>teneatur.</fo:inline></fo:block>
<fo:block id="W0111-00-0102-it-07d5" text-align="justify" start-indent="16pt" space-before="0.2cm" space-after="0.2cm"><fo:inline> </fo:inline><fo:inline space-before="0.2cm" space-after="0.2cm"><fo:basic-link internal-destination="W0111-00-0104-mi-075b" color="#0a0c75">17</fo:basic-link> </fo:inline> <fo:inline font-style="italic">Rei duo debendi <fo:inline font-weight="normal">s</fo:inline>i obligentur in<fo:inline font-weight="normal">s</fo:inline>olidum, <fo:inline font-weight="normal">s</fo:inline>i ambo <fo:inline font-weight="normal">s</fo:inline>int<fo:inline> </fo:inline>præ<fo:inline font-weight="normal">s</fo:inline>entes in loco, quod vnus prototo conueniri non<fo:inline> </fo:inline>poßit.</fo:inline></fo:block>
</fo:block>
</fo:block>
